OL,3,GNEWSASudden school closure leaves SEND
OL,4,Achild without place
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a child with special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities who
OL,8,Fwas attending a private school when it
OL,9,Fclosed suddenly has said she is
OL,10,Fstruggling to find a new place.
OL,12,FScarlett, who has ADHD, autism and
OL,13,Fdyslexia, has been out of education for
OL,14,Fnearly two weeks since Leweston School,
OL,15,Fin Dorset, shut down during half term.
OL,17,FHer mother, Camille, said several
OL,18,Fschools had been unable to accommodate
OL,19,Fthe 15-year'old's needs, leaving the
OL,20,Ffamily at their "wits' end".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
