OL,3,GNEWSASudden school closure leaves SEND
OL,4,Achild without place
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Council, which provides Scarlett
OL,7,Fwith a fully funded place, said it was
OL,8,F"working closely" with families
OL,9,Faffected by the school's closure. A
OL,10,Fschool spokesman said it "deeply
OL,11,Fregrets" the displacement of pupils at
OL,12,Fshort notice.
